#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "That GPU node or GPU does not exist, or is on a device you do not have access to."
msgstr "Kókó GPU tàbí GPU yẹn kò sí, tàbí ó wà lórí ẹ̀rọ tí o kò ní àṣẹ sí."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU data query could not be added to the device. Check that the plugin's templates are installed."
msgstr "A kò lè fi ìbéèrè dátà GPU kún ẹ̀rọ náà. Ṣàyẹ̀wò pé a ti fi àwọn àdàkọ àfikún náà sórí ẹ̀rọ."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Device: the node's device was deleted, so the node can only be disabled."
msgstr "Ẹ̀rọ: a ti pa ẹ̀rọ kókó náà rẹ́, nítorí náà a kàn lè pa kókó náà lẹ́nu iṣẹ́ nìkan."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Device: choose an existing Cacti device."
msgstr "Ẹ̀rọ: yan ẹ̀rọ Cacti tí ó ti wà tẹ́lẹ̀."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Device: this device is already a GPU node."
msgstr "Ẹ̀rọ: ẹ̀rọ yìí ti jẹ́ kókó GPU tẹ́lẹ̀."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node was saved."
msgstr "A ti fi kókó GPU náà pamọ́."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node could not be saved."
msgstr "A kò lè fi kókó GPU náà pamọ́."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node was removed. Its Cacti device was left in place."
msgstr "A ti yọ kókó GPU náà kúrò. A fi ẹ̀rọ Cacti rẹ̀ sílẹ̀ ní ipò rẹ̀."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node was not removed because GPU records belong to it. Disable it instead; GPU records are never deleted."
msgstr "A kò yọ kókó GPU náà kúrò nítorí àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ GPU jẹ́ tirẹ̀. Pa á lẹ́nu iṣẹ́ dípò rẹ̀; a kì í pa àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ GPU rẹ́ láé."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU now belongs to the node it was seen at, with its history."
msgstr "GPU náà ti di ti kókó tí a ti rí i báyìí, pẹ̀lú ìtàn rẹ̀."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU stays with its recorded node."
msgstr "GPU náà dúró pẹ̀lú kókó tí a kọ sílẹ̀ fún un."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU will leave the data query at the next reindex. Its graphs and RRD files are kept."
msgstr "GPU náà yóò kúrò nínú ìbéèrè dátà ní ìtúnkọ-àtọ́ka tó kàn. A pa àwọn àwòrán-ìṣirò àti àwọn fáìlì RRD rẹ̀ mọ́."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Only an absent GPU can be removed from the data query."
msgstr "GPU tí kò sí níbẹ̀ nìkan ni a lè yọ kúrò nínú ìbéèrè dátà."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Creating a device needs permission to manage Cacti devices."
msgstr "Ṣíṣẹ̀dá ẹ̀rọ nílò àṣẹ láti ṣàkóso àwọn ẹ̀rọ Cacti."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Description: enter up to 150 printable characters."
msgstr "Àpèjúwe: tẹ̀ sínú rẹ̀ títí dé àmì-ìkọ̀wé tí ó ṣeé tẹ̀ jáde 150."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Hostname: enter a host name or IP address."
msgstr "Orúkọ-olùgbàlejò: tẹ orúkọ olùgbàlejò tàbí àdírẹ́sì IP sínú rẹ̀."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU Node device template is not installed."
msgstr "A kò fi àdàkọ ẹ̀rọ Kókó GPU sórí ẹ̀rọ."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device was not kept: your account may not see devices it creates. Ask an administrator to create it."
msgstr "A kò pa ẹ̀rọ náà mọ́: àkọọ́lẹ̀ rẹ kò lè rí àwọn ẹ̀rọ tí ó ṣẹ̀dá. Béèrè lọ́wọ́ alákòóso láti ṣẹ̀dá rẹ̀."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device could not be removed after access was refused. Ask an administrator to remove it."
msgstr "A kò lè yọ ẹ̀rọ náà kúrò lẹ́yìn tí a kọ̀ láti fún ní àṣẹ. Béèrè lọ́wọ́ alákòóso láti yọ ọ́ kúrò."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device and its GPU node were created. Set the device's SNMP settings on its device page."
msgstr "A ti ṣẹ̀dá ẹ̀rọ náà àti kókó GPU rẹ̀. Ṣètò àwọn ìtò SNMP ẹ̀rọ náà lórí ojú-ewé ẹ̀rọ rẹ̀."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device could not be created; see the Cacti log."
msgstr "A kò lè ṣẹ̀dá ẹ̀rọ náà; wo àkọsílẹ̀ Cacti."

#: gpu_operator.php
msgid "Monitoring view"
msgstr "Ìwòran àbójútó"

#: gpu_operator.php
msgid "Observations could not be read. Ask an administrator to check the plugin log."
msgstr "A kò le ka àwọn àkíyèsí. Béèrè lọ́wọ́ alákòóso láti ṣàyẹ̀wò àkọsílẹ̀ àfikún náà."

